The '''Hub Selector''' is an [[NPC]] that serves as a means to change [[Hub]] server. They are located near the portal in the center of the {{zone|Village}}<!-- and in [[Dungeon Hub]]-->.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
*The ability to warp to a small server is exclusive to {{RN|VIP}} [[player]]s and above.
*The '''Hub Selector'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s name is displayed in bold above their head.

